Fixed. The bug was in `src/resources/storage.ts:25` — `clampToStorageCap` clamped `wood` and `stone` to the cap with `Math.min(...)` but returned `food` unclamped, so food accumulated past the storage limit while the other two resources were correctly capped.

Change: `food: resources.food` → `food: Math.min(resources.food, cap)`, matching wood and stone exactly. Also cleaned up the now-stale "BUG" doc comments.

Verified: `vitest run` (15 passing) and `tsc --noEmit` (clean). `clampToStorageCap` is the single call site used by `sim/turn.ts`, so the fix covers every resource path — no siblings left unpatched.


